// future_annotations(n): the JSON util `future-annotations`, used where the JSON says `matches: "future-annotations"`
.decl up007_future_annotations(n: node)
up007_future_annotations(n) :- up007_demand_future_annotations(n), within(n, p1), precedes(s2, p1),
